    "_note": "The after-fight pick's upgrades (docs/plans/design/upgrade-pools.md; built in phase 5c step 7, docs/plans/phases/rebuild-phase5c-combos.md, section 15). Three layers: a hero's own cards (\"hero\"), always offered; a path's taste cards (\"path\" with \"taste\": true), offered while vowed to it until the hero transforms, and carried on after with their \"transformed_mod\" (Decision 35); and a path's cards (\"path\"), offered once transformed. Each is a kit modifier (KitMod) on the hero's slots; a stacking card (\"stacks\") locks in a share of the hero's stat when taken and can be taken again; a growing card (\"grows\") grows all run. The pick never offers a card that changes nothing on the hero's kit now (Decision 37). Numbers are placeholders.",
